    "detailed_description": "A treasure hunt game where you interact with everything in Kili's house to help her find the treasure hidden by her mother.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Interact with nearly every item in the house.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1219020/extras/7f1cb3d7e243b94e3fb8b31c028379b8.poster.avif?t=1644934673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1219020/extras/7f1cb3d7e243b94e3fb8b31c028379b8.webm?t=1644934673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1219020/extras/7f1cb3d7e243b94e3fb8b31c028379b8.mp4?t=1644934673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Read the clues left by Mom carefully.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1219020/extras/1b55a62e8f86906b926eb8aa9add44c1.poster.avif?t=1644934673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1219020/extras/1b55a62e8f86906b926eb8aa9add44c1.webm?t=1644934673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1219020/extras/1b55a62e8f86906b926eb8aa9add44c1.mp4?t=1644934673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Relive the story of a girl and her best friend</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore six different rooms with over 45 different interactable objects each with their own significance.<br></li><li>Follow over 30 clues to find the treasure.<br></li><li>Experience a short and sweet story of a girl and her best friend.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "A treasure hunt game where you interact with everything in Kili's house to help her find the treasure hidden by her mother.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Interact with nearly every item in the house.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1219020/extras/7f1cb3d7e243b94e3fb8b31c028379b8.poster.avif?t=1644934673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1219020/extras/7f1cb3d7e243b94e3fb8b31c028379b8.webm?t=1644934673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1219020/extras/7f1cb3d7e243b94e3fb8b31c028379b8.mp4?t=1644934673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Read the clues left by Mom carefully.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1219020/extras/1b55a62e8f86906b926eb8aa9add44c1.poster.avif?t=1644934673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1219020/extras/1b55a62e8f86906b926eb8aa9add44c1.webm?t=1644934673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1219020/extras/1b55a62e8f86906b926eb8aa9add44c1.mp4?t=1644934673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Relive the story of a girl and her best friend</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore six different rooms with over 45 different interactable objects each with their own significance.<br></li><li>Follow over 30 clues to find the treasure.<br></li><li>Experience a short and sweet story of a girl and her best friend.</li></ul>",
